After su'ing to root I did...

chown -R johnd *

It took a few seconds before I thought " mmm this is taking a while" & killed
it. It had chown'd /bin /etc /lib & half of /dev :-( but luckily no mounted
filesystems, it took a while to restore all the right ownerships, especially
the suid one's.

