I have a tape reader (DUMPER-32) that can read both BACKUP and DUMPER
tapes.  It is probably from the DEC Clearinghouse tape.  We've used it to
read old DUMPER tapes (as long as there aren't any parity errors!) a couple
of times.  I can put it up for FTP if there's any interest.

