REDWOOD CITY, Calif., April 14, 1993 - NeXT Computer, Inc. today
announced partnerships with several major PC manufacturers and a
national distributor to sell NEXTSTEP for Intel 80486 and
Pentium-based PCs, beginning May 25.

NEXTSTEP for Intel processors runs on a wide range of
industry-standard Intel486- and Pentium-based desktop and portable
computers and will ship worldwide on May 25 in conjunction with the
1993 NeXTWORLD Expo in San Francisco and Spring Comdex in Atlanta.
