The maximum size of a pixmap is totaly implementation dependent. Since X is
network transparent, your application must be able to display on any variety
of X-servers. As many servers, from DEC and from other vendors, limit the size 
of the pixmap to the size of the screen, your application must be able to deal
with this limit. That is, if you want to be interoperable

/Peter

