Judging by your note I shall assume you are new to VMS.
Unlike Unix where the C runtime library libc.a gets linked
in by default, you would have to explicitly do so on VMS.

Therefore try 

$ LINK HELLO, SYS$LIBRARY:VAXCRTL/LIB

For further information on how to link and run C programs please
read the VAX runtime manual.

