> Nope.  AudioFile is it.
> 
> You are best off picking up a current version from crl.dec.com
> via anonymous FTP; quite a few bugs have been fixed since the initial version
> which is what is on the CD.  I don't know what your problem is when building
> AF; but you should build from our current version, rather than the version
